WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Devon Russell: We've had a handful of requests for fully remote arrangements outside the standard hybrid policy.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Maria Chen: Let's review them individually, exceptions should stay rare and well documented.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Devon Russell: Two are relocation-related and one is a caregiving accommodation request.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Maria Chen: The caregiving case should route through the accommodation process, not a policy exception.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Devon Russell: I'll redirect that one and bring the other two back with manager recommendations.
